<title>USA: American General Hospitality in first payout.</title>
<headline>American General Hospitality in first payout.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>American General Hospitality Corp said on Thursday that it has set an initial distribution of $0.2746, based on a pro rata quarterly dividend rate of $0.4075.</p>
<p>The company's dividend reflects a distribution from the July 31, 1996, initial public offering of its stock through September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable October 31, 1996, to shareholders of record on October 15, 1996, the company said.</p>
